<mxCell id="t105" value="documents.subject_type / subject_id is a plain informational pointer into whichever module attached the document (e.g. &#39;legal.case_hdrs&#39; / &#39;4821&#39;) — never a real FK, since DMS cannot reach into another module&#39;s schema (§5 of spec). FK* rows (document_versions.uploaded_by, access_logs.actor_id) reference the platform&#39;s own public.users table, which lives outside the DMS schema and is not modeled here — shown as a dashed pointer to an external placeholder box instead of a solid FK edge. Dashed edges throughout = informational/non-enforced references, not DB constraints." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4A5563;align=left;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="970" width="900" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
